function makeZone2IslandAlpha(period:string){const night=period==='night',base=makeMon(night?120:129,night?32:30),alphaBase=night?base:{...base,moves:['하이드로펌프',...(base.moves||[]).filter((m:string)=>m!=='하이드로펌프')].slice(0,4),adventureAlphaMove:'하이드로펌프'};return {...makeAdventureAlpha(alphaBase),boxId:'wild',adventureAlphaId:'zone2-island'};}
