function recordMission40Anomaly(s:any,foe:any){if(s.zaMission40Stage!==1)return;const tag=String(foe?.adventureMissionId||''),id=tag.startsWith('mission40-')?tag.slice(10):'';if(Object.hasOwn(ANOMALIES,id))s.zaMission40Anomalies=[...new Set([...anomalyIds(s),id])];}
